{"id": "t101-058", "text": "Theo, or Teddy as his mates call him, said his lab Juno just had six puppies. He's keeping one", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teddy", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mates", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "lab Juno", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "six puppies", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t101-059", "text": "had dinner at Nasser and Emil's last night, lovely. Emil does amazing bread, he's thinking about a baking course in the spring. Nasser was quieter than usual, his company is doing redundancies on May 14 and he doesn't know yet if he's on the list. They've also just booked Japan for March 2027 so the timing is awful.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bread", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baking course", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "quieter than usual", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "redundancies", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Japan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 2027", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t101-060", "text": "Note to self: Lior has been having a rough time since the redundancy in September. He's applying for everything. His partner Akira says he's barely sleeping. I should invite him to the pub quiz on Thursday and not mention jobs at all, just let him have a night off.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lior", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rough time", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "redundancy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Akira", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "barely sleeping", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite him to the pub quiz", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
